---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | One Take Wonder Marketing"
  description="One Take Wonder Marketing is a full-service marketing agency with over 10 years of experience helping local businesses grow. Customized strategies, proven ROI. Based in the USA."
>

<!-- Page Hero -->
<section class="bg-gray-900 py-20 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
    <p class="text-brand-pink-light font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-4">About Us</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">Over a Decade of <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-pink-light to-brand-pink bg-clip-text text-transparent">Proven Marketing</span></h1>
    <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      One Take Wonder Marketing has spent more than 10 years helping local businesses grow through customized marketing strategies that deliver measurable ROI.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Our Story -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-3">
        <p class="section-label">Our Story</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-6">Built for Businesses That Want <span class="gradient-text">Real Results</span></h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          One Take Wonder Marketing was founded on a simple belief: marketing should prove its worth. Over the past decade, we've grown from a small consultancy into a full-service marketing agency serving local businesses across the country.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We're not a one-person shop. We're a team of strategists, creative directors, media buyers, designers, and analysts who work together to deliver complete marketing solutions for our clients. Every team member brings specialized expertise — and every client gets the full benefit of our collective experience.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          What sets us apart: we never pitch a strategy we can't measure. Every campaign we run is tied to clear KPIs and reported transparently. We succeed when our clients see real growth — and after 10+ years, that's exactly what keeps happening.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-8 text-white">
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-pink-light">10+</div>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Years in Business</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-pink-light">Full</div>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Service Team</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-pink-light">Proven</div>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm">ROI Delivery</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-pink-light">100%</div>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Custom Strategies</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- What We Believe -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">Our Approach</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">What <span class="gradient-text">Drives Us</span></h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        These principles guide every campaign, every recommendation, and every client relationship.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <span class="text-brand-pink font-extrabold text-xl">1</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Customized to Your Budget</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We don't believe in one-size-fits-all packages. Every strategy we build is designed around your specific budget, goals, and market. We find the most effective channels for what you can invest — and make every dollar count.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <span class="text-brand-pink font-extrabold text-xl">2</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Always Proving ROI</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Marketing without measurement is just guessing. We track everything, report transparently, and connect every campaign directly to business outcomes. You'll always know exactly what your marketing investment is delivering.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <span class="text-brand-pink font-extrabold text-xl">3</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Full-Service, Full Commitment</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We're not just a digital agency. We cover the entire marketing spectrum — TV, OTT, radio, print, digital, social, creative, and web. Whatever channel your audience is on, we can reach them there with a cohesive message.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <span class="text-brand-pink font-extrabold text-xl">4</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Long-Term Partnerships</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Our longest client relationships span over a decade. We invest in understanding your business deeply because the best marketing strategies get better over time — not worse.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <span class="text-brand-pink font-extrabold text-xl">5</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Team-Based Service</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Every client gets a dedicated team — not a single point of contact who might leave. Your account is managed by a strategist, creative lead, and media buyer working together on your success.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <span class="text-brand-pink font-extrabold text-xl">6</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Local Business Focus</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We specialize in helping local and regional businesses compete and win. We understand the dynamics of local markets and know how to make marketing budgets work harder at the community level.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Who We Serve -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
    <p class="section-label">Who We Serve</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading mb-6">Local Businesses Ready to <span class="gradient-text">Grow</span></h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg mb-12">
      Our clients span industries and markets, but they all share one thing in common: they're serious about growth and want a marketing partner who is too.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Healthcare</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Home Services</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Retail & eCommerce</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Professional Services</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Restaurants & Hospitality</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Automotive</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Real Estate</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">And More</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-900">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">
      Let's Build Something <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-pink-light to-brand-pink bg-clip-text text-transparent">Great Together</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-10">
      Ready to work with a marketing agency that actually proves its value? Let's talk.
    </p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary text-lg !px-10 !py-4">Get Your Free Proposal</a>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
